  "content": "<h1><a href=\"./README.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">鐵砧工藝</a> | AnvilCraft</h1><p><span><span><span><span><span><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/w_cn-mf-qk8?si=papv6yvqzHqDAvQa\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/actions/workflows/ci.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/AnvilCraft/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg\" alt=\"開發版本\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/anvilcraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_986251_downloads.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載數\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fanvilcraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/anvilcraft?color=00AF5C&amp;label=Modrinth 下載數&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載數\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Gu-ZT/AnvilCraftMod/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Gu-ZT/AnvilCraftMod/total?label=GitHub 下載數&amp;logo=github\" alt=\"GitHub 下載數\"></a></p><h2>Minecraft 模組由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f19822751\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">古鎮天Gugle@bilibili</a> &amp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f5930630\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">XeKr@bilibili</a> 製作</h2><blockquote>\n  <p>歡迎來到名為 AnvilCraft 的 Minecraft 模組頁面！這個模組是一個以鐵砧為核心的生存擴展，包含以下功能：</p>\n</blockquote><ul>\n<li>吸引：將鐵砧吸入空中，補充紅石後釋放</li>\n<li>粉碎：將岩石粉碎成粉末</li>\n<li>壓榨：從方塊中擠出液體</li>\n<li>物品壓縮：壓縮鬆散物品</li>\n<li>切割：分離緊密物品</li>\n<li>輾壓：將材料壓成薄片</li>\n<li>膨脹：用水使材料膨脹</li>\n<li>結晶：用細雪使材料結晶</li>\n<li>壓合：將兩個方塊壓成一個</li>\n<li>方塊破壞：在石切台上破壞方塊</li>\n</ul><h2>聯絡我們：</h2><ul>\n<li>請前往我們的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fgAnWeZNKGh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器（gAnWeZNKGh）</a> 進行交流與反饋</li>\n</ul><h2>貢獻者列表：</h2><table>\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/XeKr\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45423407?v=100&amp;s=100\" width=\"100px;\" height=\"100px\" alt=\"\"><br>\n        <strong>XeKr</strong>\n      </a><br>\n      <a rel=\"nofollow\">🎨</a> \n      <a rel=\"nofollow\">🤔</a><br>\n      <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f5930630\" rel=\"nofollow\">5930630</a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Gu-ZT\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34372427?v=100&amp;s=100\" width=\"100px\" height=\"100px\" alt=\"\"><br>\n        <strong>古鎮天</strong>\n      </a><br>\n      <a rel=\"nofollow\">💻</a><br>\n      <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f19822751\" rel=\"nofollow\">19822751</a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Phoupraw\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50520903?v=100&amp;s=100\" width=\"100px\" height=\"100px\" alt=\"\"><br>\n        <strong>Phoupraw</strong>\n      </a><br>\n      <a rel=\"nofollow\">💻</a><br>\n      <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f43760886\" rel=\"nofollow\">43760886</a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/DancingSnow0517\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60736156?v=100&amp;s=100\" width=\"100px\" height=\"100px\" alt=\"\"><br>\n        <strong>雪舞</strong>\n      </a><br>\n      <a rel=\"nofollow\">💻</a><br>\n      <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f302121711\" rel=\"nofollow\">302121711</a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/dmzz-yyhyy\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101402767?v=100&amp;s=100\" width=\"100px\" height=\"100px\" alt=\"\"><br>\n        <strong>NightFish</strong>\n      </a><br>\n      <a rel=\"nofollow\">💻</a><br>\n      <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f574322131\" rel=\"nofollow\">574322131</a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/BOTXue\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104829942?v=100&amp;s=100\" width=\"100px\" height=\"100px\" alt=\"\"><br>\n        <strong>BOTXue</strong>\n      </a><br>\n      <a rel=\"nofollow\">🌏</a><br>\n      <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f17486924\" rel=\"nofollow\">17486924</a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/wdfaESfaef\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63187438?v=100&amp;s=100\" width=\"100px\" height=\"100px\" alt=\"\"><br>\n        <strong>wdfaESfaef</strong>\n      </a><br>\n      <a rel=\"nofollow\">💻</a><br>\n      <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f40378957\" rel=\"nofollow\">40378957</a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/ZhuRuoLing\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98583550?v=100&amp;s=100\" width=\"100px\" height=\"100px\" alt=\"\"><br>\n        <strong>ZhuRuoLing</strong>\n      </a><br>\n      <a rel=\"nofollow\">💻</a><br>\n      <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f408091828\" rel=\"nofollow\">408091828</a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/YocyCraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80801884?v=100&amp;s=100\" width=\"100px\" height=\"100px\" alt=\"\"><br>\n        <strong>YocyCraft</strong>\n      </a><br>\n      <a rel=\"nofollow\">💻</a><br>\n      <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilibili.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">null</a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Bi2Nb9O3-Studio\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92721357?v=100&amp;s=100\" width=\"100px\" height=\"100px\" alt=\"\"><br>\n        <strong>Bi2Nb9O3</strong>\n      </a><br>\n      <a rel=\"nofollow\">💻</a><br>\n      <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f528521905\" rel=\"nofollow\">528521905</a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/LemoMew\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165167973?v=100&amp;s=100\" width=\"100px\" height=\"100px\" alt=\"\"><br>\n        <strong>柠喵喵喵</strong>\n      </a><br>\n      <a rel=\"nofollow\">🐛</a><br>\n      <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f690178803\" rel=\"nofollow\">690178803</a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Cjsah\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46415647?v=100&amp;s=100\" width=\"100px\" height=\"100px\" alt=\"\"><br>\n        <strong>꧁[C̲̅j̲̅s̲̅a̲̅h̲̅]꧂</strong>\n      </a><br>\n      <a rel=\"nofollow\">💻</a><br>\n      <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f19170004\" rel=\"nofollow\">19170004</a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table><h2>特別感謝：</h2><ul>\n<li>贊助者：<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f3609691\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">楓丨淵</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f17486924\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BOTXue</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f13029727\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">塔殼take</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f509257288\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">弭憂萌蝦</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.b